    "body": "This delivers one reusable, source-bounded articulated farm-box wagon master (T-2793) and T-3173 memory/lifecycle repairs. Existing static wagons remain unchanged. Covered variants, occupied teams, riders and gait work are outside this PR.\n\nThe master includes articulated body/wheels/front gear/kingbolt/reach/pole, proposed hitch interfaces, three compressed LODs, credited construction sources and explicit reconstruction limits. The renderer fixes isolate texture ownership, release uploaded compressed copies, avoid duplicate raw-model banking, transactionally recover released textures and give each live colour material its matching shadow owner. The People HEAD probe completes its response body.\n\nPinned DEV `6c103072d` is normally merged. Its Palm House and Doane geometry, photographs, source records, generators and rights data are preserved byte for byte; all ten checked performance/test files retain the a966 bytes. Native Liberty regenerated 796 entries, preserving all 795 incoming entries and the original wagon entry. The supported 53-step SourceUse tail reached a fixed point in two laps on the preserved 4220 candidate; the actual native compiler check passed against the later 6c intake with those same exports. No owner replay was needed. Native publishing, mirror and year-pack checks passed within the unchanged 416 MiB site budget.\n\nValidation on checked `c3d98a9d70308cac17b00e3adf3777a61ecc7cb0` (tree `c0fb202a5b4c387b6f8c06f5769dcc992807e6cc`): complete native preflight PASS in 747.857s with required readers and four jobs; actual new-HEAD changelog, ID and shipped-history checks PASS. The retained 34-frame wagon study keeps exact widget/vendor inputs. Earlier a966 CI40421012712 passed all nine still-frame/memory jobs. Its focused mobile regression passed with 63\u21920\u219263 release/restoration, zero GL/request/HTTP/page/console errors and identical control pixels; three generic startup warnings remain disclosed. Those results describe that earlier world. Current-world browser/memory and fresh-head published smoke/ordinary CI remain pending.\n\nThis PR remains **draft**. Required published smoke at both widths, fresh-head ordinary CI and current-world browser qualification must finish before DEV merge. All prior failed readings and operational failures remain preserved. No broad transport, historical-specimen, photographic-town or ticket completion is claimed. Production is untouched.\n\nThe local preflight exceeded its unchanged 600-second target; the actual elapsed time above is retained without weakening an assertion or ceiling.\n",
